    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Virum: Colony</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the catastrophe, Earth lies in ruins. The alien invaders drained the planet\u2019s resources and left behind infected lands and rogue war machines. The few survivors have formed small groups, trying to start over from the remnants of the old world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You lead one of these groups. Your task is to build a settlement from the ashes, gather resources, and provide your colonists with food, water, shelter, and safety. New survivors may join you \u2014 some will be helpful, others may bring problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, explore, defend, and make tough decisions that will shape the future of your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage limited resources: food, water, materials, and power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and expand your settlement in a post-apocalyptic world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a group of survivors with unique traits and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the surrounding world for resources, technologies, and new territories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience dynamic events and face the consequences of your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your colony against external threats and internal dangers</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Virum: Colony</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the catastrophe, Earth lies in ruins. The alien invaders drained the planet\u2019s resources and left behind infected lands and rogue war machines. The few survivors have formed small groups, trying to start over from the remnants of the old world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You lead one of these groups. Your task is to build a settlement from the ashes, gather resources, and provide your colonists with food, water, shelter, and safety. New survivors may join you \u2014 some will be helpful, others may bring problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, explore, defend, and make tough decisions that will shape the future of your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage limited resources: food, water, materials, and power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and expand your settlement in a post-apocalyptic world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a group of survivors with unique traits and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the surrounding world for resources, technologies, and new territories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience dynamic events and face the consequences of your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your colony against external threats and internal dangers</p></li></ul>",
